          "group_id": null,
          "turn_index": 2,
          "reply_to": "42:60054",
          "msg_uid": "42:61206",
          "body": "（抹了把汗，没接那瓶葡萄糖）先紧着苗。人扛得住。",
          "ctx": {
            "initiator": "P001",
            "mood": "紧绷",
            "need": {
              "leisure": 0
            },
            "relation": 3,
            "topic": "scarce_buy",
            "trigger": "reply"
          }
        },
        {
          "seq": 62214,
          "round": 43,
          "type": "MSG_DM",
          "from": "P005",
          "to": "P001",
          "group_id": null,
          "turn_index": 3,
          "reply_to": "42:61206",
          "msg_uid": "42:62214",
          "body": "（把葡萄糖放回柜子里，顺手把柜门关严）行，苗先留着。你坐下，我给你量个血压——别推，量完你再走。",
          "ctx": {
            "initiator": "P001",
            "mood": "紧绷",
            "need": {
              "leisure": 0
            },
            "relation": 3,
            "topic": "scarce_buy",
            "trigger": "reply"
          }
        },
        {
